{"id":"c546da437a9d3842","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md","title":"Chain Homotopy Categories and Quasi-Isomorphisms","display":"df-chain-homotopy-category-data — Chain Homotopy Categories and Quasi-Isomorphisms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data","aliases":["58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data"],"display":"df-chain-homotopy-category-data — Chain Homotopy Categories and Quasi-Isomorphisms","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chain-homotopy-category-data — Chain Homotopy Categories and Quasi-Isomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function.md\">58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gf\">\\(gf\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_X\">\\(1_X\\)</span> 分别为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a> 的 Hom 集、源靶、复合及单位箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak a\">\\(\\mathfrak a\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>复形码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\langle C_\\bullet,d_C\\rangle\">\\(C=\\langle C_\\bullet,d_C\\rangle\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\bullet:\\mathbb Z\\to O\">\\(C_\\bullet:\\mathbb Z\\to O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_C:\\mathbb Z\\to M\">\\(d_C:\\mathbb Z\\to M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j=C_\\bullet(j)\">\\(C_j=C_\\bullet(j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{C,j}=d_C(j)\">\\(d_{C,j}=d_C(j)\\)</span>。所有次数为整数，不将其限为非负次数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_{C,D}^{\\mathcal A}=\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyClass}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\">\\([f]_{C,D}^{\\mathcal A}=\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyClass}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\)</span>，只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为相应链映射时使用。箭头码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C,D,[f]\\rangle_3\">\\(\\langle C,D,[f]\\rangle_3\\)</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span> 为定义域的有限函数，显式保存源、靶及同伦类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A},\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A},s_K,t_K,c_K,e_K\">\\(\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A},\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A},s_K,t_K,c_K,e_K\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(K_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 由下式给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:C\\to D\">\\(f:C\\to D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:D\\to E\">\\(g:D\\to E\\)</span> 的链映射类型下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CokernelIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{CokernelIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\exists C_\\bullet\\in O^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\exists d_C\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\nC=\\langle C_\\bullet,d_C\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\nd_C(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_\\bullet(j),C_\\bullet(j-1))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(d_C(j)d_C(j+1),C_\\bullet(j+1),C_\\bullet(j-1),\\mathcal A)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\exists C_\\bullet\\in O^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\exists d_C\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\nC=\\langle C_\\bullet,d_C\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\nd_C(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_\\bullet(j),C_\\bullet(j-1))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(d_C(j)d_C(j+1),C_\\bullet(j+1),C_\\bullet(j-1),\\mathcal A)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\n\\land f\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n(f(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_j,D_j)\n\\land d_{D,j}f(j)=f(j-1)d_{C,j}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\n\\land f\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n(f(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_j,D_j)\n\\land d_{D,j}f(j)=f(j-1)d_{C,j}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}_S(f,g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathfrak a\\in V\\;\\exists h\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(h(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_j,D_{j+1})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land f(j)=\\mathfrak a(\\langle C_j,D_j\\rangle)\n\\left(\\left\\langle g(j),\\mathfrak a(\\langle C_j,D_j\\rangle)\n(\\langle d_{D,j+1}h(j),h(j-1)d_{C,j}\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}_S(f,g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathfrak a\\in V\\;\\exists h\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(h(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_j,D_{j+1})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land f(j)=\\mathfrak a(\\langle C_j,D_j\\rangle)\n\\left(\\left\\langle g(j),\\mathfrak a(\\langle C_j,D_j\\rangle)\n(\\langle d_{D,j+1}h(j),h(j-1)d_{C,j}\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyClass}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\{g\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}:\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}_S(f,g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyClass}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\{g\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}:\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}_S(f,g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j,g(j)f(j)\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j,g(j)f(j)\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in O^{\\mathbb Z}\\times M^{\\mathbb Z}:\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle C,D,[f]_{C,D}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3:\nC,D\\in\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\land f\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\},\\\\\ns_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,u(0)\\rangle:u\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\qquad\nt_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,u(1)\\rangle:u\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\\\\nc_K\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle\\langle v,u\\rangle,\n\\langle u(0),v(1),[\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)]_{u(0),v(1)}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3\\Bigr\\rangle:\nu,v\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\land u(1)=v(0)\\land f\\in u(2)\\land g\\in v(2)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\ne_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,\\langle C,C,[\\{\\langle j,1_{C_j}\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb Z\\}]_{C,C}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3\\rangle:\nC\\in\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\qquad\nK_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A},\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A},s_K,t_K,c_K,e_K\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in O^{\\mathbb Z}\\times M^{\\mathbb Z}:\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle C,D,[f]_{C,D}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3:\nC,D\\in\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\land f\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\},\\\\\ns_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,u(0)\\rangle:u\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\qquad\nt_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,u(1)\\rangle:u\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\\\\nc_K\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle\\langle v,u\\rangle,\n\\langle u(0),v(1),[\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)]_{u(0),v(1)}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3\\Bigr\\rangle:\nu,v\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\land u(1)=v(0)\\land f\\in u(2)\\land g\\in v(2)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\ne_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,\\langle C,C,[\\{\\langle j,1_{C_j}\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb Z\\}]_{C,C}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3\\rangle:\nC\\in\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\qquad\nK_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A},\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A},s_K,t_K,c_K,e_K\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land K=K_{\\mathcal A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land K=K_{\\mathcal A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k,b,q,C,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land k,b,q\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,d_{C,n},\\mathcal A)\n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_{n+1},s(k))\\land kb=d_{C,n+1}\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,b,\\mathcal A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k,b,q,C,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land k,b,q\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,d_{C,n},\\mathcal A)\n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_{n+1},s(k))\\land kb=d_{C,n+1}\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,b,\\mathcal A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists k_C,b_C,q_C,k_D,b_D,q_D,z,u\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k_C,b_C,q_C,C,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k_D,b_D,q_D,D,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land z\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(s(k_C),s(k_D))\\land k_Dz=f(n)k_C\\\\\n&amp;\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(t(q_C),t(q_D))\\land uq_C=q_Dz\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(u,\\mathcal A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists k_C,b_C,q_C,k_D,b_D,q_D,z,u\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k_C,b_C,q_C,C,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k_D,b_D,q_D,D,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land z\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(s(k_C),s(k_D))\\land k_Dz=f(n)k_C\\\\\n&amp;\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(t(q_C),t(q_D))\\land uq_C=q_Dz\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(u,\\mathcal A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>复形由范畴对象和箭头组成，不要求范畴对象本身是阿贝尔群的底集。</li>\n<li>同伦范畴的箭头是带源靶标签的链映射同伦类；复合在代表元上逐次数定义，再取类。</li>\n<li>拟同构通过核、余核给出的同调对象及其实际诱导箭头检查。不会把商类本身当作逐次数函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}$、$s,t$、$gf$、$1_X$ 分别为 [[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]] 的 Hom 集、源靶、复合及单位箭头。$\\mathfrak a$ 使用 [[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的 $\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}$、$s,t$、$gf$、$1_X$ 分别为 [[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]] 的 Hom 集、源靶、复合及单位箭头。$\\mathfrak a$ 使用 [[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的 $\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CokernelIn}$、$\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}$、$\\mathrm{KernelIn}$、$\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"gf","display":false},{"tex":"1_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\langle C_\\bullet,d_C\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"C_\\bullet:\\mathbb Z\\to O","display":false},{"tex":"d_C:\\mathbb Z\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"C_j=C_\\bullet(j)","display":false},{"tex":"d_{C,j}=d_C(j)","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_{C,D}^{\\mathcal A}=\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyClass}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle C,D,[f]\\rangle_3","display":false},{"tex":"3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A},\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A},s_K,t_K,c_K,e_K","display":false},{"tex":"K_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)","display":false},{"tex":"f:C\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"g:D\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CokernelIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KernelIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\exists C_\\bullet\\in O^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\exists d_C\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\nC=\\langle C_\\bullet,d_C\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\nd_C(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_\\bullet(j),C_\\bullet(j-1))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(d_C(j)d_C(j+1),C_\\bullet(j+1),C_\\bullet(j-1),\\mathcal A)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\n\\land f\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n(f(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_j,D_j)\n\\land d_{D,j}f(j)=f(j-1)d_{C,j}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}_S(f,g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\mathfrak a\\in V\\;\\exists h\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(h(j)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_j,D_{j+1})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad\\land f(j)=\\mathfrak a(\\langle C_j,D_j\\rangle)\n\\left(\\left\\langle g(j),\\mathfrak a(\\langle C_j,D_j\\rangle)\n(\\langle d_{D,j+1}h(j),h(j-1)d_{C,j}\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyClass}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\{g\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}:\\mathrm{ChainHomotopicIn}_S(f,g,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j,g(j)f(j)\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in O^{\\mathbb Z}\\times M^{\\mathbb Z}:\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle C,D,[f]_{C,D}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3:\nC,D\\in\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\land f\\in M^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\},\\\\\ns_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,u(0)\\rangle:u\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\qquad\nt_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,u(1)\\rangle:u\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\\\\nc_K\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle\\langle v,u\\rangle,\n\\langle u(0),v(1),[\\mathrm{ZChainMapComposite}_S(g,f)]_{u(0),v(1)}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3\\Bigr\\rangle:\nu,v\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\land u(1)=v(0)\\land f\\in u(2)\\land g\\in v(2)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\ne_K\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,\\langle C,C,[\\{\\langle j,1_{C_j}\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb Z\\}]_{C,C}^{\\mathcal A}\\rangle_3\\rangle:\nC\\in\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\},\\qquad\nK_{\\mathcal A}\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A},\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A},s_K,t_K,c_K,e_K\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land K=K_{\\mathcal A}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k,b,q,C,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZChainComplexIn}_S(C,\\mathcal A)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land k,b,q\\in M\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,d_{C,n},\\mathcal A)\n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(C_{n+1},s(k))\\land kb=d_{C,n+1}\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,b,\\mathcal A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZChainMapIn}_S(f,C,D,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists k_C,b_C,q_C,k_D,b_D,q_D,z,u\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k_C,b_C,q_C,C,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZChainHomologyData}_S(k_D,b_D,q_D,D,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n&\\land z\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(s(k_C),s(k_D))\\land k_Dz=f(n)k_C\\\\\n&\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(t(q_C),t(q_D))\\land uq_C=q_Dz\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(u,\\mathcal A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6095,"backlinks":[{"id":"cebafbaa76b53fc9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K_{\\mathcal A}$、$\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}$、$\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}$、$[f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C'}$ 及 $\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S$ 来自 [[58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md]]；复形次数为 $\\mathbb Z$。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md|58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["2aed7ac2ed3313e0","e637becf421e4e61","36d7463d215be751"]}